--- !u!114 &641963865
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 641963857}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: edc64bf0e94e4f14cb52a496a3ddd5d7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  interactText:
  - It's one of Mom's wine fridges.
  - She and Dad got into a lot of arguments over these things.
  - He told her she wasn't being responsible with her money, and I guess he was right.
  - Mom just told him it was an investment, and that she was allowed to spend her
    money however she pleased, which I guess was also right.
  - I think I can see one of her old bottles still lying around in there.
  - But the fridge won't open until I set it to the right temperature.
  - I'm pretty sure Mom kept her 'wine secrets' behind the cabinet, I used to climb
    in there when I was younger.
  collectable: 0
  interactable: {fileID: 0}
  itemDespawn: 0
  beingInteracted: 0
  canDespawn: 0
  interacted: 0
